menu "Profile: wlink (wireless link to the dongle)"

    config WLINK_DEVICE_NAME
        string "Advertised BLE name"
        default "esp32s3-headset"
        help
            What a scanner shows. The dongle does not match on it — it matches on
            the audio link service UUID — so this is for people and phones.

    config WLINK_SPEAKER_SAMPLE_RATE_HZ
        int "Downlink (speaker) sample rate (Hz)"
        default 48000
        help
            Must equal the dongle's DONGLE_SPEAKER_SAMPLE_RATE_HZ: it is part of
            the format code every audio frame carries, and frames in another
            format are dropped and reported (FW-LNK-019). 8000, 12000, 16000,
            24000 or 48000 (the rates Opus codes natively).

    config WLINK_SPEAKER_CHANNELS
        int "Downlink (speaker) channels"
        default 2
        range 1 2

    config WLINK_MIC_SAMPLE_RATE_HZ
        int "Uplink (microphone) sample rate (Hz)"
        default 16000
        help
            Must equal the dongle's DONGLE_MIC_SAMPLE_RATE_HZ. Mono.

    config WLINK_PLAYBACK_RING_MS
        int "Playback ring capacity (ms of audio)"
        default 120
        range 40 500
        help
            The elastic buffer between the radio and the I2S clock. It holds the
            servo's setpoint (the dongle's DONGLE_PATH_TARGET_MS, most of which
            sits here) plus the retransmission bursts the link delivers after a
            fade. main/ sizes the one playback ring for the larger of this and
            USOUND_PLAYBACK_RING_MS. 120 ms at 48 kHz stereo is 23040 bytes of
            internal RAM.

    config WLINK_STATS_PERIOD_S
        int "Log link and playback counters every (s); 0 = never"
        default 5
        range 0 3600
        help
            One console line per period with the link's and the playback driver's
            counters — the headset half of a two-board soak (scripts/link_soak.py).

    config WLINK_RECONNECT_GRACE_S
        int "Keep advertising after the dongle is lost for (s)"
        default 20
        range 1 600
        help
            While the link is down the profile keeps the radio up and
            advertising for this long before reporting itself not live, which
            lets main/ drop to IDLE and release the stream lock. A dongle that
            comes back within the window reconnects without a mode change.

endmenu
